      "_intent": "Non-React Implementations [draft]",
      "_title": {
        "text": "Non-React Implementations"
      },
      "_lines": [
        {
          "_text": {
            "text": "React is used to encapsulate a library of components which embody our design language. We welcome the community to implement our design system in other front-end frameworks of their choice."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_intent": "Companies using antd [draft]",
      "_title": {
        "text": "Companies using antd"
      },
      "_lines": [
        {
          "_text": {
            "text": "Ant Design is widely used for building enterprise-level websites both domestically and internationally. You can refer to wappalyzer for reference data. If your company or product uses Ant Design, let us know here!"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_intent": "Contributing [draft]",
      "_title": {
        "text": "Contributing"
      },
      "_summary": {
        "text": "Please read our CONTRIBUTING.md first."
      },
      "_lines": [
        {
          "_text": {
            "text": "If you'd like to help us improve antd, just create a Pull Request. Feel free to report bugs and issues here."
          }
        },
        {
          "_text": {
            "text": "If you're new to posting issues, we ask that you read How To Ask Questions The Smart Way and How to Ask a Question in Open Source Community and How to Report Bugs Effectively prior to posting. Well written bug reports help us help you!"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
